{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼見てこれー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/05/2299744/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/05/2299744/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ママが買ってきてくれたクッキー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな種類があったみたいだけど、\nちょうちょ、イグアナ、カメレオン...\n私がすきなのセレクトしてくれた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/05/2299744/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいすぎて食べたくない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/05/2299744/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ひなちまがすごいのー\n大人なオーラが出ておる。\n色気付いてきてメンバーみんな\nきゅんきゅんなのー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/05/2299744/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...いいなぁいいなぁ。\nいやいや、このままじゃ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダメでしょ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということなので、今頑張っている。\n＼目指せー大人ー！／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...白い目に見るなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/05/2299744/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！\n私にはわかるんだぞー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真剣だもん！応援してねーっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/05/2299744/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/05/2299744/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/05/2299744/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......\n今日はMJの収録で\n4th表題曲を初披露しました！\nタイトルは......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「制服のマネキン」!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クイズには正解したかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/05/2299744/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は選抜だけでなく、\nアンダーもバックダンサーとして\n表題曲を盛り上げます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46が踊りまくる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/05/2299744/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/05/2299744/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/05/2299744/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キレかっこいいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダー曲もお楽しみに♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/05/2299744/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べるさゆにゃんをひたすらいじる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日も頑張りまりか♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}